  ## Force HTTPS
	# RewriteCond %{HTTPS} off
	# RewriteRule (.*) https://%{HTTP_HOST}%{REQUEST_URI} [L,R=301]

  ## Force HTTPS behind a proxy/load balancer (if %{HTTPS} is always "off" there)
